{ Remember to like the study! Now what if black does not just blunder (straight away 😏)? Click the space bar to find out! }
7... e6 { We simply develop for now. } { [%csl Gd3][%cal Gf1d3] } 8. Bd3 { We build up to launch a tactical DESTRUCTION on the black king. 🎯💥 } 8... Bd6 { Now we can just castle, develop our rook, and win. 😉 } 9. O-O Rf8 { Now how can we strike in the center with our lone steed? } 10. Ne5+ { CHARGE!!! } 10... Bxe5 { This is the most played move, and a losing blunder! Just take back for now! } { [%csl Ge5][%cal Gd4e5] } 11. dxe5 Nd5 { Mr. Check! } { [%csl Gh5][%cal Gd1h5] } 12. Qh5+ Kg8 { Black thinks he can hide behind his pawns, but he is mistaken. 😏 Blow up the kingside! 💥 } 13. Bxh6 gxh6 { *Sigh* Most popular, another losing mistake. How can we end the came RIGHT NOW!!! 😱😲🤯🎉🥳 } 14. Qg6+ { Yep. :) } 14... Kh8 { The king is still trying to hide from us. Has your opponent resigned yet? 🏳 } 15. Qh7# { Check and mate. In only 15 moves! 😃 } *


