{ But what if your opponent plays Bf5? 🤔 }
7... Bf5 { Now we can either play boring or play for an AWESOME trap to which only 12% find the answer! 😱 } { [%csl Gg2] } 8. g4 { This is the trap! The best move for black is to take with the knight (12%) but we can still have a fun game. Most common is the blunder Bxg4?? which is like what we covered first. Lastly, we have the given move. } 8... Bg6 9. Ne5+ { Mr. Fork. 😃 We eat the bishop next turn. +3.6, Great job! 😃 } *


