[ChapterMode "gamebook"]

{ Now a REALLY prepared opponent will play the given move, but we will still counter it efficiently. 😏 }
7... c5 { c5!!!!! The best move!!!!! But now, instead of freaking out, realize what black has in mind. He is clearing the way for Nc6, so how can we stop this (and set a nasty trap 😏)? } 8. d5 { Brilliant!!! Most people will see Nxd5??, but dismiss it because of c4 (pin to queen). So they just take with the queen. } 8... Qxd5 { Oh no now we're REALLY losing...... wait........ are we? Can you see a creative pin? } 9. Bc4 { Yes! You found it! } 9... Qxc4 { Pretty much forced. Now in this position, every single one of the 499 games make the same move. What? } 10. Ne5+ { Mr. Fork returns. +3.8, Awesome job! 🥳 } { [%csl Rf7,Rc4][%cal Re5f7,Re5c4] } *


